@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix w3: <http://www.w3.org/>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix xmls: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.

<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl> a owl:Ontology;
                                                                 rdfs:comment """This is the decision ontology (v.2). Let me know if you would like to participate in developing, testing or supporting this project.

If you need help in using the Decision Ontology or the imported Requirement Ontology please send an email to: piotrnowara(at)gmail.com"""@en,
                                                                              """SUMMARY:
1. Decision-making is initiated by some underlying problem that can be represented in form of a question.

2. Decision-making is a process that can result in some decision and decision is a situation of indicating one of the considered options. Decision Ontology provides means for precise distinguishing and distinct treatment of these two aspects.

3. Option is a considered situation of choosing some specific solution.

4. Options can have associated criteria that is requirements, recommendation (or other normative entities) that should be applied to them."""@en,
                                                                              "Author: Piotr Nowara  (piotrnowara(at)gmail.com)"@en;
                                                                 rdfs:seeAlso "Requirement Ontology website: https://requirement-ontology.googlecode.com/"@en,
                                                                              "Decision Ontology website: http://code.google.com/p/decision-ontology/"@en,
                                                                              "An example: http://code.google.com/p/decision-ontology/wiki/DecisionOntologyExample"@en;
                                                                 owl:imports <https://requirement-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/requirement_ontology.owl>;
                                                                 owl:versionInfo "2012_04_18_1".
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Answer> a owl:Class;
                                                                        rdfs:comment "Indication of something requested in a question."@en;
                                                                        rdfs:label "Answer"@en;
                                                                        rdfs:subClassOf [owl:unionOf ([owl:someValuesFrom owl:Thing ; 
                                                                                                      owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#indicates> ; 
                                                                                                      a owl:Restriction]
                                                                                                      [owl:someValuesFrom xsd:boolean ; 
                                                                                                      owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#indicates_boolean_value> ; 
                                                                                                      a owl:Restriction]) ; 
                                                                                         a owl:Class],
                                                                                        [owl:someValuesFrom <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Question> ; 
                                                                                         owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_answer_for> ; 
                                                                                         a owl:Restriction],
                                                                                        [owl:unionOf ([owl:someValuesFrom owl:Thing ; 
                                                                                                      owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#indicates> ; 
                                                                                                      a owl:Restriction]
                                                                                                      [owl:someValuesFrom xsd:boolean ; 
                                                                                                      owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#indicates_boolean_value> ; 
                                                                                                      a owl:Restriction]) ; 
                                                                                         a owl:Class],
                                                                                        [owl:someValuesFrom <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Question> ; 
                                                                                         owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_answer_for> ; 
                                                                                         a owl:Restriction],
                                                                                        <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Situation>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Context> a owl:Class;
                                                                         rdfs:label "Context"@en;
                                                                         rdfs:subClassOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Situation>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Decision> a owl:Class;
                                                                          rdfs:comment "Recognizing something as the right/appropriate/best possible solution to a question/problem. It can be a consequence of an objective evaluation of clearly defined criteria but also an intuition, emotion or other subjective factor."@en;
                                                                          rdfs:label "Decision"@en;
                                                                          rdfs:subClassOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Situation>;
                                                                          owl:equivalentClass [owl:intersectionOf ([owl:someValuesFrom <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Option> ; 
                                                                                                                   owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#indicates> ; 
                                                                                                                   a owl:Restriction]
                                                                                                                   [owl:someValuesFrom <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Decision_making> ; 
                                                                                                                   owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_result_of> ; 
                                                                                                                   a owl:Restriction]) ; 
                                                                                               a owl:Class],
                                                                                              [owl:intersectionOf ([owl:someValuesFrom <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Option> ; 
                                                                                                                   owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#indicates> ; 
                                                                                                                   a owl:Restriction]
                                                                                                                   [owl:someValuesFrom <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Decision_making> ; 
                                                                                                                   owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_result_of> ; 
                                                                                                                   a owl:Restriction]) ; 
                                                                                               a owl:Class].
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Decision_making> a owl:Class;
                                                                                 rdfs:comment """2011-10-13
A complex process that starts with a question and may result in indication of a solution for the underlying problem. It is important to note that a decision-making is something substantially different than decision, which is an output of the process of deciding. Usually it can be represented by the following pattern:
1. Decision-making starts with a question which is an utterance of some problem
2. The decider gathers and analyzes some information
3. The decider evaluates possible options (under some criteria).
4. One of the options may get recognized as the right/appropriate/best possible solution for the initial question/problem or the decider may choose to restrain from choice. What justifies this act could be an objective evaluation of clearly defined criteria but also an intuition, emotion or other subjective factor.

In most cases stages 2-3 consist of many (concurrent or sequential) actions, events, processes related to information gathering, processing, verifying etc. In some cases a decision-making can be viewed as a complex process involving many sub-decisions preceding the recognition of the initial problem solution. In our current work we have focused on the basic elements of the above pattern (the question, gathering information, considering options, choosing solution). It should be considered to what extent this ontology should support the modeling of correlated issues such as: information verification and retrieval etc."""@en;
                                                                                 rdfs:label "Decision making"@en;
                                                                                 rdfs:subClassOf [owl:someValuesFrom <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Option> ; 
                                                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_consideration_of> ; 
                                                                                                  a owl:Restriction],
                                                                                                 [owl:someValuesFrom <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Question_for_indicating> ; 
                                                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_initiated_by> ; 
                                                                                                  a owl:Restriction],
                                                                                                 [owl:someValuesFrom <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Option> ; 
                                                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_consideration_of> ; 
                                                                                                  a owl:Restriction],
                                                                                                 [owl:someValuesFrom <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Question_for_indicating> ; 
                                                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_initiated_by> ; 
                                                                                                  a owl:Restriction],
                                                                                                 <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Process>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Option> a owl:Class;
                                                                        rdfs:comment "Option has usually some related criteria which correspond to requirements, recommendations etc."@en;
                                                                        rdfs:label "Opcja"@pl,
                                                                                   "Option"@en;
                                                                        rdfs:seeAlso <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#has_criterion>,
                                                                                     <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Decision_making>;
                                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Situation>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Problem> a owl:Class;
                                                                         rdfs:label "Problem"@en;
                                                                         rdfs:subClassOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Situation>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Process> a owl:Class;
                                                                         rdfs:label "Process"@en.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Question> a owl:Class;
                                                                          rdfs:comment "A situation in which a person indicates a will for acquiring knowledge about something."@en;
                                                                          rdfs:label "Question"@en;
                                                                          rdfs:subClassOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Situation>;
                                                                          owl:equivalentClass [owl:someValuesFrom owl:Thing ; 
                                                                                               owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_question_for> ; 
                                                                                               a owl:Restriction],
                                                                                              [owl:someValuesFrom owl:Thing ; 
                                                                                               owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_question_for> ; 
                                                                                               a owl:Restriction].
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Question_for_confirming> a owl:Class;
                                                                                         rdfs:comment """A question containing a whole proposition, that is an utterance that could be true or false. It is answerd by confirming or denying that proposition ('yes/no question')

Examples: Are you a vegetarian? Is Norway a member of UE?"""@en;
                                                                                         rdfs:label "Question for confirming"@en;
                                                                                         rdfs:subClassOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Question>;
                                                                                         owl:equivalentClass [owl:intersectionOf ([owl:someValuesFrom owl:Thing ; 
                                                                                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_question_for_confirming> ; 
                                                                                                                                  a owl:Restriction]
                                                                                                                                  [owl:allValuesFrom [owl:someValuesFrom xsd:boolean ; 
                                                                                                                                                     owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#indicates_boolean_value> ; 
                                                                                                                                                     a owl:Restriction] ; 
                                                                                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#has_answer> ; 
                                                                                                                                  a owl:Restriction]) ; 
                                                                                                              a owl:Class],
                                                                                                             [owl:intersectionOf ([owl:someValuesFrom owl:Thing ; 
                                                                                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_question_for_confirming> ; 
                                                                                                                                  a owl:Restriction]
                                                                                                                                  [owl:allValuesFrom [owl:someValuesFrom xsd:boolean ; 
                                                                                                                                                     owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#indicates_boolean_value> ; 
                                                                                                                                                     a owl:Restriction] ; 
                                                                                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#has_answer> ; 
                                                                                                                                  a owl:Restriction]) ; 
                                                                                                              a owl:Class].
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Question_for_indicating> a owl:Class;
                                                                                         rdfs:comment """A question demanding indication of some concept, thing or its property in order to be anwsered.

Examples: What's your date of birth? What is the name of the Director of the W3C?"""@en;
                                                                                         rdfs:label "Question for indicating"@en;
                                                                                         rdfs:subClassOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Question>;
                                                                                         owl:equivalentClass [owl:intersectionOf ([owl:someValuesFrom owl:Thing ; 
                                                                                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_question_for_indicating> ; 
                                                                                                                                  a owl:Restriction]
                                                                                                                                  [owl:allValuesFrom [owl:someValuesFrom owl:Thing ; 
                                                                                                                                                     owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#indicates> ; 
                                                                                                                                                     a owl:Restriction] ; 
                                                                                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#has_answer> ; 
                                                                                                                                  a owl:Restriction]) ; 
                                                                                                              a owl:Class],
                                                                                                             [owl:intersectionOf ([owl:someValuesFrom owl:Thing ; 
                                                                                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_question_for_indicating> ; 
                                                                                                                                  a owl:Restriction]
                                                                                                                                  [owl:allValuesFrom [owl:someValuesFrom owl:Thing ; 
                                                                                                                                                     owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#indicates> ; 
                                                                                                                                                     a owl:Restriction] ; 
                                                                                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#has_answer> ; 
                                                                                                                                  a owl:Restriction]) ; 
                                                                                                              a owl:Class].
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Question_for_indicating_solution> a owl:Class;
                                                                                                  rdfs:label "Question for indicating solution"@en;
                                                                                                  rdfs:subClassOf [owl:someValuesFrom <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Problem> ; 
                                                                                                                   owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_consequence_of> ; 
                                                                                                                   a owl:Restriction],
                                                                                                                  [owl:someValuesFrom <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Problem> ; 
                                                                                                                   owl:onProperty <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_consequence_of> ; 
                                                                                                                   a owl:Restriction],
                                                                                                                  <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Question_for_indicating>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Situation> a owl:Class;
                                                                           rdfs:label "Situation"@en.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#has_answer> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                            rdfs:domain <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Question>;
                                                                            rdfs:label "has answer"@en;
                                                                            rdfs:range <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Answer>;
                                                                            owl:inverseOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_answer_for>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#has_consequence> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                                 rdfs:domain <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Situation>;
                                                                                 rdfs:label "has consequence"@en;
                                                                                 rdfs:range <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Situation>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#has_context> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                             rdfs:label "has context"@en;
                                                                             rdfs:range <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Context>;
                                                                             rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#occurs_in>;
                                                                             owl:inverseOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_context_of>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#has_result> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                            rdfs:label "has result"@en.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#has_solution> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                              rdfs:domain <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Problem>;
                                                                              rdfs:label "has solution"@en;
                                                                              owl:inverseOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_solution_for>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#includes> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                          rdfs:label "includes"@en;
                                                                          rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_occurence_of>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#indicates> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                           rdfs:label "wskazuje"@pl,
                                                                                      "indicates"@en;
                                                                           owl:inverseOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_indicated_by>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#indicates_boolean_value> a owl:DatatypeProperty.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#initiates> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                           rdfs:label "initiates"@en;
                                                                           rdfs:range <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Process>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#involves_choosing> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                                   rdfs:label "involves choosing"@en;
                                                                                   rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_occurence_of>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_adressed_to> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                                rdfs:label "is adressed to"@en.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_answer_for> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                               rdfs:domain <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Answer>;
                                                                               rdfs:label "is answer for"@en;
                                                                               rdfs:range <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Question>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_consequence_of> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                                   rdfs:domain <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Situation>;
                                                                                   rdfs:label "is consequence of"@en;
                                                                                   rdfs:range <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Situation>;
                                                                                   owl:inverseOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#has_consequence>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_consideration_of> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                                     rdfs:domain <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Process>;
                                                                                     rdfs:label "is consideration of"@en.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_considered_during> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                                      rdfs:label "is considered during"@en;
                                                                                      rdfs:range <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Process>;
                                                                                      owl:inverseOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_consideration_of>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_context_of> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                               rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_occurence_of>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_included_in> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                                rdfs:label "is included in"@en;
                                                                                rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#occurs_in>;
                                                                                owl:inverseOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#includes>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_indicated_by> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                                 rdfs:label "is indicated by"@en.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_initiated_by> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                                 rdfs:domain <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Process>;
                                                                                 rdfs:label "is initiated by"@en;
                                                                                 owl:inverseOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#initiates>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_occurence_of> a owl:ObjectProperty.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_question_for> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                                 rdfs:domain <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Question>;
                                                                                 rdfs:label "is question for"@en.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_question_for_confirming> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                                            rdfs:domain <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Question>;
                                                                                            rdfs:label "is question for confirming"@en;
                                                                                            rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_question_for>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_question_for_indicating> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                                            rdfs:domain <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Question>;
                                                                                            rdfs:label "is question for indicating"@en;
                                                                                            rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_question_for>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_result_of> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                              owl:inverseOf <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#has_result>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#is_solution_for> a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                                 rdfs:label "is solution for"@en;
                                                                                 rdfs:range <http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#Problem>.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#occurs_in> a owl:ObjectProperty.
<http://decision-ontology.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/decision.owl#supposedly_same_as> a owl:SymmetricProperty,
                                                                                      owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                                                    rdfs:comment "Using to indicate supposedly same individuals (like in the context of a question where someone suppose some individual has certain properties or when introducing some unverified statements)."@en,
                                                                                                 "Renamed from 'is supposed to be identical with'."@en;
                                                                                    rdfs:label "supposedly same as"@en.
